@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title Purchase commit and recovery
participant ShopUI as UI
participant ClientHandler as H
participant "UserManager::Transaction" as T
participant CsvStore as S
database CSV as D
UI -> H : BUY_ICON
H -> T : Validate balance and ownership
activate T
H -> T : Stage profile and inventory
H -> T : Commit()
T -> S : Commit(afterImages)
S -> D : Publish flushed redo journal
S -> D : Replace each CSV atomically
S -> D : Remove completed journal
S --> T : true
T --> H : Commit succeeded
deactivate T
H -> UI : COIN_INFO + STORE_ICON_LIST
UI -> UI : Update balance and owned items
note over T,D
One user-state lock from validation through commit.
Precommit failure restores memory.
Postcommit replacement failure stops the process; startup replays the journal.
end note
@enduml
